      "commands": [
        "workbench.action.keepEditor"
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "9 · 🛡 Check on the path: DOMPurify.sanitize",
      "description": "**Control:** `isomorphic-dompurify` 2.36.0 (DOMPurify 3.4.16 on jsdom), default configuration. It removes `<script>`, event-handler attributes and `javascript:` URLs, and it runs on the HTML **after** `marked`, on every render. Nothing modifies the string after it.\n\n**Observed (local, 2026-10-06):** the seeded `<img>` comes out as `<img src=\"x\">`, with the event handler removed.\n\n**Next →** the sanitised string becomes `comment.html` (step 10).",
      "file": "src/utils/markdown.js",
      "pattern": "(DOMPurify\\.sanitize)\\(",
      "selection": {
        "start": {
          "line": 4,
