    {
      "title": "12 · ⚠️ SINK: <%- comment.html %>",
      "description": "**Sink:** `<%-` writes the string without escaping, inside a `<div>` (HTML body context). `comment.author` and the date on line 17 use `<%=` and are escaped.\n\n**Sink receives:** `<p>Delivery was <strong>fast</strong>, thanks! Tracking: <a href=\"https://example.com/track\">carrier site</a></p>` for seeded comment 1 (observed through `markdown.render`, not through the page).\n\n**Path summary:** `req.body.body` (user, any logged-in user; read by anonymous visitors) → stored → `marked` → 🛡 DOMPurify (last) → raw HTML output.",
